@crew mbeki-bo
// Writer (command), batch 2: everyday lines (greet, feel, near, life, joy) from the card and the roster.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Hey. Mbeki, Survey. Labs on Deck 2. Ask me anything. I'll check before I answer.
? tier>=acquaintance
- Hello, {me}. Telescope's clean, sums are done. Good day so far.
- Hi there, {me}. Music room tonight? I've a new piece. Practised it exactly.
? tier>=friend
- {hi}, {me}. I made two of my sister's biscuits. To the gram. One's yours.   #warm
== feel
? mood:high
- Good day. Every sum right the first time. I checked twice anyway.
? mood:low
- Off day. I've checked the same number three times. That's a tell.
== near
? habit:musician
- Music room. I play it exactly as written. Then once more, a bit less exactly.
? time:night
- My telescope's cleaner than the big one. Don't tell the observatory.   #funny
== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- My sister on Kesh sends recipes. "A handful of flour." Whose hand? How big?   #funny
== joy
? tier>=colleague
- Playing in the music room. The notes go just where they should. Nothing in between.
